{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52206","headline":"颂六十二首 三十一 · 道世","name":"颂六十二首 三十一","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"静念遗志虑，有虑非理尽。\n境来投虚空，虚空何所轸。\n托阴游重冥，冥亡影迹陨。\n四果皆欣求，一乘独玄泯。\n（见同书卷四六《摄念部》）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"道世","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_52206.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52206","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}